Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle for the Red Stone of Asia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo versus Wamuu in a\None-on-one chariot duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time is upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the full moon once again emerges from\Nbehind that cloud, the battle will begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish they wouldn't make all that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that the bad\Nguys get all the fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One lap is 960 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes approximately one minute\Nfor these beasts to complete a lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.18,0:00:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that column over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On each lap a different weapon\Nwill be hanging from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.36,0:00:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weapon at at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.28,0:00:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whichever of us can capture\Nthat column before the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other will then have the\Nopportunity to wield the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see the first one up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant sledgehammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing could smash right\Nthrough a chariot in one blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If wamuu was able to get his hands on it,\Nmy situation isn't just going to be bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it could be terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I can get to it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cover it with oil and fill it with\NHamon, then victory will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am looking forward to an excellent,\Nfulfilling fight from you, Jojo. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.96,0:01:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon approaches the cloud's edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.90,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When its light falls upon\Nus, the contest begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, what are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The race is about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:02:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The start will be the key, and I\Nsure don't want to mess that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm checking\Nthe rubble under my wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got quite a big\Npile under your buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take care of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begin now!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.30,0:02:49.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.30,0:02:49.77,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.61,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.61,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.61,0:02:56.98,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.61,0:02:56.98,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:02:56.98,0:03:04.24,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.98,0:03:04.24,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.99,0:03:10.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.99,0:03:10.79,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.99,0:03:10.79,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.79,0:03:19.51,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.79,0:03:19.51,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.51,0:03:25.60,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.51,0:03:25.60,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.39,0:03:32.23,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.39,0:03:32.23,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
