Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.23,0:03:36.07,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.07,0:03:41.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.07,0:03:41.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.32,0:03:44.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.83,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.83,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.83,0:03:50.66,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.83,0:03:50.66,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.66,0:03:56.46,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
