Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.68,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1330,865)}Episode 22: "A True Warrior" {Toni, Check that the title matches the preview at the end of 21 -Fadeout4}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wabu is having trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His chariot is just standing there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.80,0:04:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, his wheels are blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, he did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cheeky little devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You piled them there while we turned\Nour attention to watching the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.40,0:04:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are nothing but a cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rotten human cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me in the handbook where it\Nsays I can't do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you told me was to lose means to die,\Nand that was the only rule in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to my survival,\NI don't care who I offend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beep, beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human's getting close\Nto the column! Yah! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo will be the first one to the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes yes yes yes I can't wait\Nto have you in my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you you're mine damn I'm going\Na lot faster than I thought I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stay there Jojo it snagged\Nmy ring couldn't have predicted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that great that was lucky now\Nthe The fight is in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my plan from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see Wamuu has a plan in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fighting genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little oil up here, add some pommel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a little medicine\Nfor you right here, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu's starting to lose speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are in a fight to the death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The keys to winning are\Ntactics and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Control of the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.34,0:06:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just slow down and introduce him\Nto my little friend here, the hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, listen, you mustn't\Nslow down anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're the one with the\Nhammer, I'll just get something else.
