Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Wamu, are you ready to see\Nexactly what this thing can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so happy with his hammer\Nat first, but not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure plans ahead better than I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go faster and get away from him, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, you will no\Nlonger have your chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.98,0:07:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things seem to be over a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might want to rethink his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.36,0:07:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The probability of him being\Ntrampled by my vampire horses is 90%.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chance of him attempting\Nto break left is 5%,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and breaking to the right is 5%.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now then, what is our little\Nhuman warrior going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is my hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants his hammer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he hit his head too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hammer's not going to save you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo must not dodge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does, Wamuu will stop and\Nfinish him with his divine sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.58,0:08:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what Jojo did was grab the hammer\Nand head straight for Wamuu's chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Jojo. Great thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He struck the yoke midway\Nbetween the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the horses ran on, Jojo used the hammer's\Nforce to launch himself into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That move was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hammer's life kept him from being\Ntrampled under the hooves of the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.90,0:08:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for that big hammer\Nwhack you worked so hard to earn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.62,0:08:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can clearly see that Wamu\Nis a step ahead of his quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.44,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These fellas can hide themselves\Ninside other creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.24,0:09:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His boot came off his foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boot saved him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he only had on some\Nother kind of footwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got luck on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, the way the handle of\Nthat hammer got caught on my ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luck helps with effectiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's take a look at your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu, your own power has trapped\Nyou inside of that horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little hum on for you and the\Nhorse you rode in on. You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't see the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to keep an arm's leg from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Wamuu has merged with that\Nhorse, he's free to use his hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without worrying about vibration or speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one has survived a\Ndirect hit by that attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.06,0:10:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you will taste Divine Sandstorm!
