Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it lasted only the\Ndistance of half a lap,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was a battle filled with\Nmany twists and surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, Wamu proved the\Nsuperiority of both his thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.54,0:10:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and his fighting prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the next battle is going\Nto be quite a test of will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truly, it is not my\Npreference to fight a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.44,0:10:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu dislikes it even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Notwithstanding, all users of\NHamon must be done away with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will provide a painless death thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's quite considerate\Nof you but Jojo seems
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.10,0:11:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to be a little less dead than you thought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh Lord course look\Nout there in the arena
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamu's arms They look\Nlike they're about to fall off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.84,0:11:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.36,0:11:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this have\Npossibly happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.74,0:11:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is happening to Wamu out there?\NLook! There! It's Jojo! He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I apparently managed\Nto survive once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Wamuu hit him directly with\Nhis divine sandstorm attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo was cunning enough to make\Nit look like it was a direct hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is an absolute genius at\Ntrickery and misdirection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure I should be\Ngiving him praise for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at Wamuu's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wrapped the reins around Wamuu's\Narms after filling them with Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu's divine sandstorm\Nwas short-circuited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu was already sticking\None hand out of the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was going to try to\Nuse his divine sandstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, in order to do so, I knew he'd\Nhave to stick his other hand out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I had the perfect\Ncounter for that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamu's face! Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in agony! See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem to know where he's going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His eyes are vacant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the second lap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamu can't hold a weapon like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it even possible for him to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in mid-attack, Wamu was\Nstruck with a lethal dose of Homo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The confidence built up over\Nmillennia of triumph has crumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The quiet, calm intensity his\Nvictories gave him has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tragic shock for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.92,0:13:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it matters not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put out the next set of\Nweapons and do it now!
