Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Kars has given the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.98,0:13:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he speaks, we must obey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the second lap, both\Nwarriors will receive crossbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each comes with ammunition for two shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first warrior there has the\Nchoice of the small or large bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.16,0:13:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a large one and\Nanother that's smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lisa, Lisa, this is what's\Ngoing through your thoughts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu's mind is in no\Ncondition to entertain a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why then would Kars be\Ndeploying these new weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.16,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and with such apparent confidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very unsettling, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the reason is that at his core, Wamuu\Nis a warrior of legendary mental power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The very best athletes use a psychological\Ntechnique called the Switch Comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When these champions are brought low by\Nthe pressure of shock, failure, or fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can flip a mental\Nswitch and bring out their
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting spirit for one\Nlast Herculean effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperate times call for desperate\Nmeasures, and Wamuu will win at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.28,0:14:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he really just do that? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Lord Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, his eyes are gone!
