Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I foolishly relied on my eyes\Nbecause I was able to see,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Jojo exploited my weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I will use this horn to see things\Noutlined in wind instead of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flipped the switch by removing\Nhis eyes from the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he is once again\Npsychologically invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He senses the wind with\Nthat horn on his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.70,0:15:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sees air better than he did light. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not going to have any effect on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of you, I lost my friend Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try any trick you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes\Nto finish the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, which crossbow will you take?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the answer to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The large one, you stupid morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Power is what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta admit that one does have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, lots of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even draw this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so tight, I can't get the\Nstring to go anywhere at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got greedy, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a normal crossbow takes a huge\Namount of strength to draw back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to have the big one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what greed gets you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use the first ball to\Npaint a picture of the wind.
