Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I know what the range\Nis, the next shot will not miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to defend myself\Nif I can't shoot this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wobble, shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow us the smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us snack on whatever\Nsmall pieces remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind stirred up by these fires makes\Nit hard for him to figure out where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an error.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.40,0:17:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underestimating Wamul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wamuu's pointing away from Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's turned this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's aiming at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo is staying on the\Nopposite side from Wamuu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thinking to shelter behind the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, he has only served\Nto point out his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what Wamuu is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's banking it like it's a billion shot!
