Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.80,0:18:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was examining the terrain\Nwhile we were circling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.28,0:18:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to find the proper wall\Nplacement to use as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ball lost some of its momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it did not pierce Jojo's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.32,0:18:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's spitting up a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which would then betoken some injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish him now, Wamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But remember how wily and\Nfull of tricks Jojo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he set another trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I hit the ground, the\Nimpact cocked my crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't kill him from this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closer, a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.22,0:19:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhh! Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.42,0:19:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His aim was off though,\Nunfortunately for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I really must commend him for\Nstaying in the fight until the very last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over, Jojo. No! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't take anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to spam me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm. Shameful. Look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sniveling coward's throwing rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just a pathetic loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to go down like a man,\Nyou disgusting little worm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is the very next thing that\Nwill come out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare dishonor\Nour battle here, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare dishonor\Nour battle here, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that a bat could\Nsimply fly right between
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all those rocks and\Navoid every little piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you avoid them like that, Wamuu?
