Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.16,0:20:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An iron ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It showed up out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the human just\Ntook you down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I banked the shot\Njust like you did earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arena went silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one individual made a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't even a moan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu's injury peered out like the\Nsneering face of a jack-o'-lantern.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The iron ball carried with\Nit a small amount of hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wound began to fester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamu's damaged arms grew even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more divine sandstorms, now or ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to try to breathe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get my hormone in balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying a kick after faking a fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if you still\Nthink you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,REBUFF OVERDRIVE!
