Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wamuu won't be getting up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has become of the great Wamuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:22:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mighty warrior is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,12,000 years of victory, reduced to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms, his arms are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not Uamo's way\Nto give up an easy win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wounds are only to flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My losses are a path to ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.38,0:22:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will use all of these\Nthings for victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.62,0:22:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He threw them using his chest wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've grabbed Jojo and are choking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.06,0:22:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't gather my hormone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.74,0:22:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wind, it's flowing towards Wamuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind obeys me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.98,0:23:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my ultimate mastery!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate mastery?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you shouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Wamuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must not be done!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.28,0:23:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is going into those pipes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate mastery, atmospheric rift!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.09,0:23:30.80,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I will remember you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.80,0:23:34.39,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Your silhouette will charge the view
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.12,0:23:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just in the wind,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.39,0:23:39.68,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Of distant atmosphere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll charge the view of this atmosphere,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.68,0:23:42.31,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.70,0:23:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cold at morning, driving through the sun,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.31,0:23:46.36,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Even in the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even in the valley, in and around\Nthe lake, models come out of the sky,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.36,0:23:48.74,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.03,0:23:52.11,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.11,0:23:53.99,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.04,0:24:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere and we'll see you?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.16,0:24:00.83,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten two summers, we'll be\Nthere and I'm laughing too!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.58,0:24:07.30,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty four before my love, you'll see.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.05,0:24:13.72,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.82,0:24:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:13.72,0:24:18.72,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.48,0:24:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Among the jumping crowd, the eagles\Nsearching down on the ground!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:37.78,0:24:43.25,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Along the drifting cloud, the eagle searching down on the land
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.54,0:24:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching the sliding green, the\Nsilver seas, the men of the land!
Dialogue: 1,0:24:44.83,0:24:50.13,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Catching the swirling wind, the sailor sees the rim of the land
Dialogue: 1,0:24:51.88,0:24:57.10,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The eagle's dancing wings create, as weather spins out of hand
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.60,0:24:59.60,Title2.1,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.60,0:24:59.60,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\pos(960,700)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowardly animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.66,0:25:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the method, utilize\Nremarkable you crossed a line!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No honor earns you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.32,0:25:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No consideration!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.26,0:25:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world and all in it belong to me.
